#: includes/class-settings.php:40
msgid "Load Bootstrap CSS"
msgstr "Bootstrap CSS laden"

#: includes/class-settings.php:41
msgid "Off by default. Leave it off when your theme already loads Bootstrap."
msgstr "Standardmäßig ausgeschaltet. Bitte lassen Sie den Schalter aus, wenn Ihr Theme Bootstrap bereits lädt."

#: includes/class-settings.php:47
msgid "Load Bootstrap JavaScript bundle"
msgstr "Bootstrap-JavaScript-Bundle laden"

#: includes/class-settings.php:48
msgid "The bundle includes Popper, which dropdowns, tooltips and popovers require."
msgstr "Das Bundle enthält Popper, das Dropdowns, Tooltips und Popovers benötigen."

#: includes/class-settings.php:54
msgid "Load Bootstrap Icons"
msgstr "Bootstrap Icons laden"

#: includes/class-settings.php:55
msgid "Switchable separately: many themes ship Bootstrap but no icon font."
msgstr "Getrennt schaltbar: Viele Themes liefern Bootstrap, jedoch keine Icon-Schrift."

#: includes/class-settings.php:61
msgid "Also output the legacy areoi-* classes"
msgstr "Zusätzlich die alten areoi-*-Klassen ausgeben"

#: includes/class-settings.php:62
msgid "Turn this off only once the theme of this site no longer styles against areoi-* selectors."
msgstr "Bitte schalten Sie dies erst ab, wenn das Theme dieser Website nicht mehr gegen areoi-*-Selektoren stylt."

#: includes/class-settings.php:68
msgid "Register areoi/* blocks as aliases"
msgstr "areoi/*-Blöcke als Aliasse registrieren"

#: includes/class-settings.php:69
msgid "Keeps content that has not been migrated yet renderable. Alias blocks are hidden from the inserter."
msgstr "Hält noch nicht migrierte Inhalte darstellbar. Die Aliasblöcke sind in der Blockauswahl ausgeblendet."

#: includes/class-settings.php:230
msgid "Bootstrap assets"
msgstr "Bootstrap-Assets"

#: includes/class-settings.php:237
msgid "Backwards compatibility"
msgstr "Rückwärtskompatibilität"

#: includes/class-settings.php:265
msgid "All three switches are off by default. Bootstrap then comes from the theme, exactly as before."
msgstr "Alle drei Schalter sind standardmäßig ausgeschaltet. Bootstrap kommt dann wie bisher von Ihrem Theme."

#: includes/class-settings.php:275
msgid "These switches keep existing pages working. A constant of the same name in wp-config.php overrides the setting."
msgstr "Diese Schalter halten bestehende Seiten funktionsfähig. Eine gleichnamige Konstante in Ihrer wp-config.php übersteuert die Einstellung."

#: includes/class-settings.php:312
msgid "Overridden:"
msgstr "Übersteuert:"

#. translators: %s: name of a PHP constant.
#: includes/class-settings.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The constant %s in wp-config.php takes precedence over this setting."
msgstr "Die Konstante %s in Ihrer wp-config.php hat Vorrang vor dieser Einstellung."

