#: includes/i18n-strings.php:70
msgid "Column Break"
msgstr "Spaltenumbruch"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:73
msgid "Breaking columns to a new line in flexbox requires a small hack: add an element with width: 100% wherever you want to wrap your columns to a new line. Normally this is accomplished with multiple .rows, but not every implementation method can account for this."
msgstr "Ein Spaltenumbruch in Flexbox erfordert einen kleinen Kniff: Setzen Sie an der gewuenschten Umbruchstelle ein Element mit width: 100% ein. Normalerweise wird dies ueber mehrere .rows geloest; nicht jede Umsetzungsvariante laesst dies jedoch zu."

#: blocks-legacy/column-break/block.json
#: blocks/column-break/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Column Break"
msgstr "Spaltenumbruch"

#: blocks-legacy/column-break/block.json
#: blocks/column-break/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Breaking columns to a new line in flexbox requires a small hack: add an element with width: 100% wherever you want to wrap your columns to a new line. Normally this is accomplished with multiple .rows, but not every implementation method can account for this."
msgstr "Ein Spaltenumbruch in Flexbox erfordert einen kleinen Kniff: Setzen Sie an der gewuenschten Umbruchstelle ein Element mit width: 100% ein. Normalerweise wird dies ueber mehrere .rows geloest; nicht jede Umsetzungsvariante laesst dies jedoch zu."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:476
msgid "Alert"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:477
msgid "Provide contextual feedback messages for typical user actions with the handful of available and flexible alert messages."
msgstr "Geben Sie Rueckmeldung zu typischen Benutzeraktionen, mit den verfuegbaren und flexibel einsetzbaren Hinweismeldungen."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:478
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stil"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:479
msgid "Alerts are available for any length of text, as well as an optional close button. For proper styling, use one of the eight required contextual classes (e.g., .alert-success)."
msgstr "Hinweise eignen sich fuer Texte jeder Laenge und koennen einen Schliessen-Knopf enthalten. Nutzen Sie fuer die Gestaltung eine der acht Kontextklassen (z. B. .alert-success)."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:480
msgid "Display Close Button"
msgstr "Schliessen-Knopf anzeigen"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:481
msgid "Add a close button and the .alert-dismissible class, which adds extra padding to the right of the alert and positions the close button."
msgstr "Ergaenzt einen Schliessen-Knopf und die Klasse .alert-dismissible, die rechts zusaetzlichen Innenabstand erzeugt und den Knopf positioniert."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:482
msgid "Collapse"
msgstr "Aufklappbereich"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:483
msgid "Toggle the visibility of content across your project with a few classes and our JavaScript plugins."
msgstr "Blenden Sie Inhalte ueber wenige Klassen und die JavaScript-Erweiterungen ein und aus."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:484
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Geoeffnet"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:485
msgid "Set the collapsible content visible as a default."
msgstr "Stellt den aufklappbaren Inhalt von Beginn an sichtbar dar."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:486
msgid "Spinner"
msgstr "Ladeanzeige"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:487
msgid "Indicate the loading state of a component or page with Bootstrap spinners, built entirely with HTML, CSS, and no JavaScript."
msgstr "Zeigen Sie den Ladezustand einer Komponente oder Seite an, umgesetzt allein mit HTML und CSS, ohne JavaScript."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:488
msgid "The border spinner uses currentColor for its border-color, meaning you can customize the color with text color utilities. You can use any of our text color utilities on the standard spinner."
msgstr "Die Rahmen-Ladeanzeige verwendet currentColor als Rahmenfarbe; Sie bestimmen die Farbe deshalb ueber die Textfarbklassen. Auf der Standardanzeige ist jede davon einsetzbar."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:489
msgid "Border"
msgstr "Rahmen"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:490
msgid "Grow"
msgstr "Wachsend"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:491
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Farbe"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:492
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Groesse"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:493
msgid "Add .spinner-border-sm and .spinner-grow-sm to make a smaller spinner that can quickly be used within other components."
msgstr "Ueber .spinner-border-sm und .spinner-grow-sm erhalten Sie eine kleinere Anzeige, die sich in andere Komponenten einbetten laesst."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:494
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Icon"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:495
msgid "Display a Bootstrap icon in any of the available theme colours and sizes."
msgstr "Stellen Sie ein Bootstrap-Symbol in einer der verfuegbaren Themefarben und Groessen dar."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:496
msgid "Extra Small"
msgstr "Sehr klein"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:497
msgid "Extra Large"
msgstr "Sehr gross"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:498
msgid "Extra Extra Large"
msgstr "Besonders gross"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:499
msgid "Horizontal Align"
msgstr "Horizontale Ausrichtung"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:500
msgid "List Group"
msgstr "Listengruppe"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:501
msgid "List groups are a flexible and powerful component for displaying a series of content."
msgstr "Listengruppen sind eine vielseitige Komponente fuer die Darstellung aufeinanderfolgender Inhalte."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:502
msgid "Add .list-group-flush to remove some borders and rounded corners to render list group items edge-to-edge in a parent container (e.g., cards)."
msgstr "Ueber .list-group-flush entfallen Rahmen und runde Ecken, sodass die Eintraege buendig im umgebenden Element stehen (etwa in Karten)."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:503
msgid "Add .list-group-horizontal to change the layout of list group items from vertical to horizontal across all breakpoints."
msgstr "Ueber .list-group-horizontal ordnen sich die Eintraege auf allen Breakpoints nebeneinander statt untereinander an."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:504
msgid "List Group Item"
msgstr "Listeneintrag"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:505
msgid "A single item within a list group."
msgstr "Ein einzelner Eintrag in einer Listengruppe."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:506
msgid "Identifier of the surrounding block. It is set automatically and must not be changed."
msgstr "Kennung des umgebenden Blocks. Sie wird selbsttaetig vergeben und darf nicht veraendert werden."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:507
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktiv"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:508
msgid "Add .active to a .list-group-item to indicate the current active selection."
msgstr "Ueber .active kennzeichnen Sie den derzeit ausgewaehlten Eintrag."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:509
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Deaktiviert"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:510
msgid "Add .disabled to a .list-group-item to make it appear disabled. Note that some elements with .disabled will also require custom JavaScript to fully disable their click events (e.g., links)."
msgstr "Ueber .disabled wirkt der Eintrag deaktiviert. Beachten Sie, dass einzelne Elemente zusaetzliches JavaScript benoetigen, damit Klicks tatsaechlich unterbunden werden (etwa Links)."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:511
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Aktion"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:512
msgid "Contextual classes also work with .list-group-item-action. Note the addition of the hover styles."
msgstr "Die Kontextklassen greifen auch zusammen mit .list-group-item-action; ergaenzend kommen die Hover-Stile hinzu."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:513
msgid "Contextual classes"
msgstr "Kontextklassen"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:514
msgid "Use contextual classes to style list items with a stateful background and color."
msgstr "Ueber die Kontextklassen erhalten Eintraege je nach Zustand Hintergrund und Farbe."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:515
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:516
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:517
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:518
msgid "Open the link in a new tab."
msgstr "Oeffnet den Link in einem neuen Browsertab."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:519
msgid "Dropdown Item"
msgstr "Auswahleintrag"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:520
msgid "A single entry within a dropdown menu."
msgstr "Ein einzelner Eintrag innerhalb eines Auswahlmenues."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:521
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:522
msgid "Choose how you would like the item to be displayed."
msgstr "Bestimmen Sie, wie der Eintrag dargestellt wird."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:523
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Ueberschrift"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:524
msgid "Divider"
msgstr "Trennlinie"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:525
msgid "Add .active to items in the dropdown to style them as active."
msgstr "Ueber .active werden Eintraege im Menue als aktiv dargestellt."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:526
msgid "Add .disabled to items in the dropdown to style them as disabled."
msgstr "Ueber .disabled werden Eintraege im Menue als deaktiviert dargestellt."

