#: includes/i18n-strings.php:557
msgid "Modal"
msgstr "Dialog"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:558
msgid "Use Bootstrap’s JavaScript modal plugin to add dialogs to your site for lightboxes, user notifications, or completely custom content."
msgstr "Ergaenzen Sie ueber die Modal-Erweiterung Dialoge, etwa fuer Lightboxen, Benutzermeldungen oder frei gestaltete Inhalte."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:559
msgid "Backdrop"
msgstr "Hintergrundflaeche"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:560
msgid "When backdrop is set to static, the modal will not close when clicking outside of it."
msgstr "Ist die Hintergrundflaeche auf static gesetzt, bleibt der Dialog bei einem Klick daneben geoeffnet."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:561
msgid "Static"
msgstr "Statisch"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:562
msgid "Scrollable Dialog"
msgstr "Scrollbarer Dialog"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:563
msgid "When modals become too long for the user’s viewport or device, they scroll independent of the page itself."
msgstr "Ist ein Dialog fuer den Bildschirm zu lang, laesst er sich unabhaengig von der Seite scrollen."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:564
msgid "Scrollable"
msgstr "Scrollbar"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:565
msgid "Vertically Centered Dialog"
msgstr "Senkrecht zentrierter Dialog"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:566
msgid "Add .modal-dialog-centered to .modal-dialog to vertically center the modal."
msgstr "Ueber .modal-dialog-centered wird der Dialog senkrecht mittig ausgerichtet."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:567
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "Zentriert"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:568
msgid "Dialog Size"
msgstr "Dialoggroesse"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:569
msgid "Modals have optional sizes, available via modifier classes to be placed on a .modal-dialog. These sizes kick in at certain breakpoints to avoid horizontal scrollbars on narrower viewports."
msgstr "Dialoge lassen sich ueber Zusatzklassen auf .modal-dialog in der Groesse bestimmen. Diese greifen ab festgelegten Breakpoints, damit auf schmalen Bildschirmen keine waagerechten Scrollbalken auftreten."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:570
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "Vollbild"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:571
msgid "Modal Header"
msgstr "Dialogkopf"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:572
msgid "The header of a modal dialog."
msgstr "Der Kopfbereich eines Dialogfensters."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:573
msgid "Add a close button to the modal header."
msgstr "Ergaenzt den Dialogkopf um einen Schliessen-Knopf."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:574
msgid "Modal Body"
msgstr "Dialogkoerper"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:575
msgid "The body of a modal dialog."
msgstr "Der Inhaltsbereich eines Dialogfensters."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:576
msgid "Modal Footer"
msgstr "Dialogfuss"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:577
msgid "The footer of a modal dialog."
msgstr "Der Fussbereich eines Dialogfensters."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:578
msgid "Offcanvas"
msgstr "Seitenpanel"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:579
msgid "Build hidden sidebars into your project for navigation, shopping carts, and more."
msgstr "Ergaenzen Sie ausgeblendete Seitenleisten, etwa fuer Navigation oder Warenkorb."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:580
msgid "Choose whether a backdrop is shown behind the offcanvas panel."
msgstr "Bestimmen Sie, ob hinter dem Panel eine Hintergrundflaeche erscheint."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:581
msgid "Include Backdrop"
msgstr "Mit Hintergrundflaeche"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:582
msgid "No Backdrop"
msgstr "Ohne Hintergrundflaeche"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:583
msgid "Choose whether the page behind the offcanvas panel can be scrolled."
msgstr "Bestimmen Sie, ob die Seite hinter dem Panel scrollbar bleibt."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:584
msgid "Disable Scrolling"
msgstr "Scrollen sperren"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:585
msgid "Allow Scrolling"
msgstr "Scrollen erlauben"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:586
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "Platzierung"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:587
msgid "Choose the edge the offcanvas panel slides in from."
msgstr "Bestimmen Sie die Kante, von der das Panel einfaehrt."

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:588
msgid "Offcanvas Header"
msgstr "Panelkopf"

#: includes/i18n-strings.php:589
